{"4625850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unknown Horizon", "steam_appid": 4625850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2104, you were assisting with research and experimentation into a new renewal power source on a lab in orbit around Sol, when an equipment malfunction caused a massive electromagnetic disturbance, which ripped a hole in the fabric of spacetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You managed to scramble to an emergency lander pod, but as you were ejected, you were sucked through the resulting wormhole and catapulted to an unknown galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625850/extras/e0fa91140639a50fa7b6cb73a21d355e.avif?t=1783270243\" width=95 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With limited supplies and no knowledge of how to get home, you need to survive, investigate what happened, and find a way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown Horizon is a retro styled top-down space exploration adventure where you will meet new alien races, learn their secrets and build their trust to get their help to find a way home. Each faction in the galaxy can unlock different information or technology that you can use to find one of a number of ways to travel back to Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you on the horizon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GALAXY SETUP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625850/extras/0a72a6c979b8d3df8b86c4127341dc96.avif?t=1783270243\" width=620 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customisable Procedurally generated galaxy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore a unique Galaxy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Up to 1,000,000 stars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stars have orbiting planets to explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find your way around with the mini-map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>VISIT EVERY STAR SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625850/extras/21087c8ab4a5ff563f0d9b89e3099d4b.avif?t=1783270243\" width=620 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Procedurally generated star systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each star system is unique</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Visit every (non gas giant) planet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover the secrets of your galaxy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Worlds to Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625850/extras/5aed82def52ed7ed5c7588b557798db9.avif?t=1783270243\" width=620 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Procedurally generated planetscapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Walk on the surface of the planet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect resources to use or trade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Repair your ship and FLY!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Meet the Locals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625850/extras/e6c63e5678b813b52d9ee636ae4ddf07.avif?t=1783270243\" width=620 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find space stations belonging to local factions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Visit stations to trade and build reputation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find out what they know that can help you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Crafting and Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625850/extras/ed47539e6e0432722e23721e4cb4d1d8.avif?t=1783270243\" width=620 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Turn the things you find into things you can use</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Learn new recipes and blueprints to unlock new things</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Buy or craft upgrades for your ship</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2104, you were assisting with research and experimentation into a new renewal power source on a lab in orbit around Sol, when an equipment malfunction caused a massive electromagnetic disturbance, which ripped a hole in the fabric of spacetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You managed to scramble to an emergency lander pod, but as you were ejected, you were sucked through the resulting wormhole and catapulted to an unknown galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625850/extras/e0fa91140639a50fa7b6cb73a21d355e.avif?t=1783270243\" width=95 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With limited supplies and no knowledge of how to get home, you need to survive, investigate what happened, and find a way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown Horizon is a retro styled top-down space exploration adventure where you will meet new alien races, learn their secrets and build their trust to get their help to find a way home. Each faction in the galaxy can unlock different information or technology that you can use to find one of a number of ways to travel back to Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you on the horizon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GALAXY SETUP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625850/extras/0a72a6c979b8d3df8b86c4127341dc96.avif?t=1783270243\" width=620 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customisable Procedurally generated galaxy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore a unique Galaxy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Up to 1,000,000 stars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stars have orbiting planets to explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find your way around with the mini-map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>VISIT EVERY STAR SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625850/extras/21087c8ab4a5ff563f0d9b89e3099d4b.avif?t=1783270243\" width=620 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Procedurally generated star systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each star system is unique</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap